@startuml

salt
{
  <b>CURVE TRAIL: oresmd://ir/USD?type=series&instrument=ir_swap</b> | [ Back to market data ]
  --
  {#
    Series | Value
    Subclass | yield
    Derivation | IR_CURVE_BOOTSTRAP (config ...a41f, v3)
    Modified by | a.reyes | Performed by | a.reyes
    Change reason | curve.recalibrate | Commentary | "Fed repricing"
  }
  --
  <b>BLUEPRINT CHANGES</b>
  {#
    Version | When | Actor | Field | From | To
    v3 | 2026-10-06 13:40 | a.reyes | derivation_config_version | 2 | 3
    v2 | 2026-10-05 09:12 | m.oduya | derivation_config_id | ...9b02 | ...a41f
  }
  [ Compare with previous version ]
  --
  <b>BUILDS</b> | one observation time, one source, many points
  {#
    Observation time | Source | Points | Actor
    2026-10-06 14:00 | ir_curve.usd | 34 | -
    2026-10-06 13:30 | ir_curve.usd | 34 | -
    2026-10-06 11:00 | manual | 1 | -
  }
  --
  <b>PER-POINT PROVENANCE</b> | fwd_start=0D&tenor=2Y
  {#
    Field | Value
    Derivation config | ...a41f (v3)
    Source as-of | 2026-10-06 13:58
    Source series | raw_ir_usd_swap_grid
  }
  --
  <b>MANUAL ADJUSTMENTS</b>
  {#
    Node | Value | Source | Reason
    fwd_start=0D&tenor=2Y | 4.405 | manual | -
  }
  --
  <b>APPROVALS</b>
  {#
    State | Requested by | Requested at | Decided by | Decided at | Decision
    (none for this object) | - | - | - | - | -
  }
  --
  <b>PUBLISHES</b>
  {#
    Published version | Published by | Published at
    (no publish operation exists) | - | -
  }
  --
  Observations carry no actor, so a point has no version and no history. No
  market-data approval kind and no publish operation exist, so the last two
  panels are empty by construction. See the journey's What is missing.
}

@enduml
